WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.136
[Gentle music]
The VS Code extension brings everything with it. On start, it finds a .NET 10 SDK, launches the bundled server and both sidecars, and loads your solution.

00:12.686 --> 00:21.888
Everything it adds lives under SharpLsp in the Command Palette: builds, NuGet, F# Interactive, tests, debugging and the profiler.

00:25.286 --> 00:36.668
Contributors can point it at their own server and sidecar builds, in a trusted workspace only. And the same server runs in Zed, in Rider, and in any editor that speaks LSP.
